 items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The age limit for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>BHEL Engineer Trainee and Supervisor Trainee</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>\u00a0Bharti 2025</strong></span>\u00a0is as follows:</span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum age <strong>required is 18 Years &amp; The Maximum Age Is 27 Years as on 01 January 2025.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the eligibility for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>BHEL Engineer Trainee and Supervisor Trainee</strong></span>\u00a0<strong>Vacancy 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: Engineering degree or diploma (65% marks) in related field required.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <b>BHEL</b>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <strong>BHEL</strong> is https://careers.bhel.in/</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"BHEL Engineer Trainee and Supervisor Trainee Recruitment 2025\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-14726 size-full\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"829\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/BHEL-400-Engineer-Trainee-Supervisor-Trainee-Short-Notice-2025-Out-Apply-from-1st-Feb.webp\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/BHEL-400-Eng